%% id: project1-streaming-assistant-sequence
%% title: 最小 Assistant 流式对话时序
%% alt: 用户请求由会话服务保存历史并发送模型适配器，再将增量事件和用量流式返回
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant S as AssistantSession
    participant M as Model Adapter
    U->>S: prompt
    S->>S: append history
    S->>M: messages + config
    M-->>S: delta events
    S-->>U: stream + usage
